<title>CHINA: China's Q1 diesel output jumps, heavy oil drops.</title>
<headline>China's Q1 diesel output jumps, heavy oil drops.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's diesel fuel output totalled 11.6382 million tonnes in the first three months of 1997, up by 10.8 percent compared with the same period last year, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Monday.</p>
<p>Diesel fuel production in March alone was 4.2235 million tonnes, the report said. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>China produced 5.1308 million tonnes of heavy oil, down 15.5 percent compared with the year-ago period, it said.</p>
<p>China produced 1.5915 million tonnes of heavy oil in March alone, the report said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
